  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Reaction of ammonia with diborane gives initially <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> which is formulated as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msub><mi>BH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>BH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>;</mo></math>&nbsp;further heating gives borazine,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></math> known as &#39;&#39;inorganic benzene&#39;&#39; in view of its ring&nbsp;structure with alternate <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>BH</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NH</mi></math>&nbsp;groups.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msub><mi>BH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>BH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>-</mo></msup><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>Heat</mi></mover><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p></blockquote>"
